      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DRAMATIC DREAM (3) recovered from a poor start to be beaten under a length on debut over this distance at Echuca last start. Can build on that promising effort and if he jumps a bit cleaner he is the one they have to beat. BIG VEE (2) travelled midfield but lacked a kick in a disappointing effort over this course and distance last time out. Can return to the good form from earlier in the prep with the addition of winkers today. VICTIMISED (9) is back after a 24-week break. Raced twice in the maiden campaign and failed to flatter on wet tracks. Trialling well and a firmer surface might see sharp improvement. NATIVE DANCE (8) is a modestly bred mare on debut. Has been about the mark in recent jump-outs so she looks set to make an immediate impact. FLAWS AND SINS (4) has been at single-figure odds in two of his three runs but the performances have been flat. Give him one more chance with the blinkers going on.",
